      "id": "survey-selected-model",
      "subject": "DAMIT 304: selected shape and spin",
      "status": "included",
      "finding": "The official DAMIT metadata export was joined by model and asteroid identity and compared with the selected local recipe shape/model-304.txt. Model 304, version 2011-02-18, pole (266°, 5°), period 5.750249 h match the retained metadata. The archive supplies no diameter for this model; a separate scale constraint is required. This comparison checks source identity and metadata, not fresh mesh bytes, registration or the completeness of other archives.",
